        <div class="col-xs-12 abut_bodyhead"><h2>Online Check In</h2></div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 abut_bodyPrt">
            <p>We help you to take the stress out of travelling and make sure that planning a holiday trip is fun and easy. We all come across the tedious pre-arrival process which includes heavy traffic jams, long queues at airports, long waiting times and heavy rush on help desks etc which all take the fantasy of travelling. But now you can enjoy a hassle-free travel experience because check-in for your flights is just a click away. Whether you are on a business trip or want to enjoy a leisure holiday, simply check-in and reserve your preferred seat for a fee between 12 to 48 hours prior to departure. You can avail this facility from your office, home or any other location.</p>
            <p>Just select your preferred airline and select your desired seat and click the Go button to go directly to online check-in and provide the necessary basic information like name, address, credit card number along with booking confirmation number etc to enjoy a stress-free journey to your choicest destination.</p>
            <p>Note:- Before selecting any airline it is recommended to familiarise yourself with all the facilities provided by it. If the airline is not listed on the given page then it means it may not provide you the online check-in facility and this may require check-in at the airport.</p>
